Package: MsBackendParquet
Title: Apache Parquet-based Mass Spectrometry Data Backend
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ossama", family = "Edbali",
           email = "ossedb@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Mass spectrometry (MS) data backend for the Spectra
    Bioconductor package that stores and retrieves spectra and peak data
    from on-disk Apache Parquet datasets via the Apache Arrow R bindings.
    Spectra metadata together with m/z and intensity values are stored in
    a columnar Parquet format that supports compression, dictionary
    encoding and Hive-style partitioning. The backend exploits Arrow's
    lazy evaluation and predicate push-down to efficiently filter and
    subset large MS datasets without loading the full data into memory.
    Datasets can be created from raw MS data files (mzML, mzXML, netCDF)
    or by switching the backend of an existing Spectra object.
